            <h3>Immigration and Customs at Madrid-Barajas</h3>
            <p>Passengers arriving from Chicago proceed through Schengen entry controls.</p>

            <b>Requirements:</b>
            <ul>
                <li>Valid passport with minimum three months validity</li>
                <li>ETIAS authorization (once implemented) or visa if required</li>
                <li>Proof of accommodation</li>
                <li>Return or onward travel documentation</li>
            </ul>
            <p>US citizens enjoy visa-free access for tourism stays up to 90 days within any 180-day Schengen period.</p>

